==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

